    },
    "ScrubOpen": {
      "title": "ScrubOpen",
      "description": "One window's open scrub as the ledger persists it (window transient, never history): the press, the document revision it opened on, the authoring tool, the open transaction and its keyed leaves (`0`, `1`, … of the latest tick).",
